    dmo:evidenceQuote "Basal insulin should be continued in women using insulin glargine (Lantus®, Toujeo®, Semglee®, Abasaglar®), Detemir (Levemir®), NPH insulin (Insulatard®), Insuman® Basal or Humulin® I or other basal insulins but prandial insulin should be discontinued if VRIII is started" ;
