    dmo:recommendationType "Treatment" ;
    dmo:statement "Continue with the basal insulin i.e. Glargine (Lantus®, Abasaglar®, Toujeo®), Detemir (Levemir®) or Degludec (Tresiba®) but discontinue short acting insulin" ;
