    dmo:recommendationStrength "Unspecified" ;
    dmo:recommendationType "Treatment" ;
    dmo:statement "Contact the diabetes team to review the on-going post-natal insulin doses in insulin treated patients with type 1 and type 2 diabetes. The insulin dose may be 25% less than the doses needed at the end of first trimester" ;
